# 10 October 2026 : ONE ENTRY POINT per height. Base graph (its own file) plus the additive iterations listed in IterSpecs.py, each exactly 64 nodes (Iter64.run). EN: each build returns (net, final clamp). FR : un point d'entrée par height ; base puis itérations additives, 64 nodes chacune.
import sys
